[(The [env~] object reports the RMS signal level)]
[(over the last 1024 samples \050by default\051 or any)]
[(other power of 2 that's at least twice the block)]
[(size. The analysis is done in an overlapped)]
[(fashion so that results appear every N/2 points)]
[(if N is the analysis window size \050hence, by)]
[(default, at every 512 samples\051. So the larger)]
[(the window, the stabler the result and the less)]
[(frequently it appears. Computation time doesn't)]
[(depend heavily on N.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
